ople right at least we hope that we  are and action-oriented people typically  when faced with a problem or a challenge  say to themselves  the first question okay what am I gonna  do I would argue that's the wrong first  question the right first question is  what do we know how well do we  understand this circumstance and the  more we understand the circumstance the  more we go through this process that I  was just describing the more ability we  will have to unearth you know effective  strategies I love that strategy as  process  [Music]
 

